      "text": "The function R is differentiable, and R(t) gives the amount of water in a reservoir, in millions of gallons, at time t days. Selected values of R(t) are given in the table. Using the average rate of change of R over the interval \\( 2 \\le t \\le 6 \\), approximate \\( R'(3) \\). Give the exact value of the approximation and indicate units of measure.",
